{
  "name": "P09 · Deep research agent (web search + page reading + cited report)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔎 P09 · A junior analyst in a workflow\nForm with a question → agent **plans**, **searches Google**, **reads pages**, checks Wikipedia, then writes a structured report **with sources** and emails it.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "994e1e6e-ccf0-5608-91af-f948e0babb94",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Research request",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Question",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "What are the top 5 open-source alternatives to Zapier in 2026 and how do they compare on pricing and self-hosting?"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Audience",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "requiredField": true,
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Executive (1 page)"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Team (detailed)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Send report to",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8514d72a-79eb-5ec7-9671-ef0950c6e2fe",
      "name": "Research Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Question: {{ $json.Question }}\nAudience: {{ $json.Audience }}",
        "options": {
          "maxIterations": 15,
          "systemMessage": "=You are a meticulous research analyst. Today is {{ $now.toFormat('dd LLL yyyy') }}.\nProcess: 1) Break the question into 3-5 sub-questions. 2) Use google_search for each. 3) Use read_page on the 3-6 most authoritative results (official sites, docs, reputable media). 4) Cross-check claims across at least two sources; note disagreements. 5) Write the report.\nReport format (HTML): <h2>Answer in brief</h2> 3-5 bullets · <h2>Details</h2> with sub-headings · <h2>Comparison</h2> table if relevant · <h2>Caveats</h2> · <h2>Sources</h2> numbered list of URLs. Cite inline like [1]. Never invent sources or numbers; say 'not found' instead."
        }
      },
      "id": "bc783bdb-45eb-5454-a658-12781ce76d9c",
      "name": "Research Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "1b0bbbf2-006c-5aa1-923a-b559d07fbb98",
      "name": "Gemini",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "gl": "in",
          "hl": "en"
        }
      },
      "id": "f3b73b32-d26e-5c03-9de7-7811e2c1d937",
      "name": "google_search",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolSerpApi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "toolDescription": "Fetch a web page and return its readable text. Input: a full https URL from search results.",
        "url": "{url}",
        "placeholderDefinitions": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "url",
              "description": "Full https URL of the page to read",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "optimizeResponse": true,
        "responseType": "html",
        "cssSelector": "body",
        "onlyContent": true,
        "maxLength": 6000
      },
      "id": "5b997c71-7750-55d4-bcfe-edcbe745e1cc",
      "name": "read_page",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolHttpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        380,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "83854977-7669-51d8-af3b-6aa1689206f5",
      "name": "Wikipedia",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWikipedia",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Research Request').item.json['Send report to'] }}",
        "subject": "=Research: {{ $('Research Request').item.json.Question.slice(0, 80) }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<p><i>Automated research draft. Verify key facts before acting on them.</i></p>{{ $json.output }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "c5c13fc3-e075-54a0-ab5c-a291dcf0f915",
      "name": "Email Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    }
  ],
